{"ID":"20240206112419-4rczxrn","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206112419-4rczxrn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112419-4rczxrn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112430-iv605l7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112423-u2gwvwv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112430-iv605l7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:173,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:173\u0026#125;","title":"腊梅花（蜡梅）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112430-iv605l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112430-iv605l7","updated":"20240206112433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江苏、浙江、四川、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t干燥花蕾呈圆形、矩形或倒卵形，长11.5cm，宽约0.40.8cm，花被叠合作花芽状，棕黄色，下半部由多数膜质鳞片所包，鳞片黄褐色，略呈三角形，有微毛。气香，味微甜，后苦，稍有油腻感。商品有二种：素心蜡梅：花心黄色，重瓣，花瓣圆而大，朵大。红心蜡梅：花心红色，单瓣，花瓣狭而尖，朵小，质较次。\n【性味】\t辛，甘。\n【功效】\t解毒清热；理气开郁。主暑热烦渴；头晕；胸闷脘痞；梅核气；咽喉肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112423-u2gwvwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112423-u2gwvwv","updated":"20240206112423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112423-0ma3yy1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723154009-7kqc9a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723154009-7kqc9a1","updated":"20240723154305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 754px;","style":"width: 744px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 5-20240723154009-wcx1o45.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 744px;\" parent-style=\"width: 754px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 6-20240723154305-axavkaw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723154408-ktwe0xe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723154408-ktwe0xe","updated":"20240723154432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 372px;","style":"width: 362px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 7-20240723154408-tsrt23h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 362px;\" parent-style=\"width: 372px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 862px;","style":"width: 852px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 8-20240723154432-zkst3xq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 852px;\" parent-style=\"width: 862px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723154742-bez8awt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723154742-bez8awt","updated":"20240723154742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 758px;","style":"width: 748px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 11-20240723154742-jw0yllm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 748px;\" parent-style=\"width: 758px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 463px;","style":"width: 453px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 10-20240723154647-2jll8kr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 453px;\" parent-style=\"width: 463px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723154910-zgnhj2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723154910-zgnhj2x","updated":"20240723154935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 829px;","style":"width: 819px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 12-20240723154910-9owj3ud.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 819px;\" parent-style=\"width: 829px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 13-20240723154935-l6t7859.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723155124-zyj72uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723155124-zyj72uk","updated":"20240723155159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 641px;","style":"width: 631px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 15-20240723155159-9so2sd9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 631px;\" parent-style=\"width: 641px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 483px;","style":"width: 473px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 14-20240723155124-2khq3oh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 473px;\" parent-style=\"width: 483px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723153331-zfkovvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723153331-zfkovvj","updated":"20240723153801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 681px;","style":"width: 671px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 1-20240723153331-q63r5rl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 671px;\" parent-style=\"width: 681px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 541px;","style":"width: 531px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 4-20240723153801-9mih6mi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 531px;\" parent-style=\"width: 541px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723153538-caa8h8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723153538-caa8h8x","updated":"20240723153731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 2-20240723153538-t53jwug.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜡梅 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜡梅 3-20240723153731-l46wz9u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723153740-olvrrzk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240723153740-olvrrzk"}},{"ID":"20240902155852-bofmi0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-bofmi0s","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：蜡梅花"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-igxhkr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-igxhkr7","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜡梅花"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-v5uf3iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-v5uf3iw","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-cllaer0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-cllaer0","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《本草纲目》；1.《救荒本草》：蜡梅花，多生南方，今北土亦有之。其树枝条颇类李，其叶似桃叶而宽大，纹微粗，开淡黄花。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-aafzjao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-aafzjao","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：蜡梅，此物本非梅类，因其与梅同时，香又相近，色似蜜蜡，故得此名。蜡梅，小树、丛枝、尖叶。种凡三种：以子种出不经接者，腊月开小花而香谈，名狗蝇梅；经接而花疏，开时含口者，名磬口梅；花密而香浓，色深黄如紫擅者，名檀香梅，最佳。结实如垂铃，尖长寸余，子在其中，其树"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-dael9e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-dael9e0","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】LàMéiHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-zvujci0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-zvujci0","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】WintersweetFlower"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-upu08dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-upu08dp","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】腊梅花、黄梅花、铁筷子花、雪里花、巴豆花、蜡花"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-jlr1vk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-jlr1vk0","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-028h4rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-028h4rc","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蜡梅科植物蜡梅的花蕾。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-iotx0t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-iotx0t3","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Chimonanthuspraecox(L.)Link."}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-i6ytncv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-i6ytncv","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：在花刚开放时采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-te313aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-te313aw","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】蜡梅，落叶灌木，高2-4m。茎丛出，多分枝，皮灰白色。叶对生，有短柄，不具托叶，叶片卵形或矩圆状披针形，长7-15cm，宽3-7cm，先端渐尖，全缘，基部楔形或圆形，上面深绿色而光亮，老时粗糙，下面淡绿色，光滑，有时于叶脉上略被疏毛。花先于叶开放，黄色，富有香气；花被多数，呈花瓣状，成多层的覆瓦状排列，内层花被小形，中层花被较大；黄色，薄而稍带光泽，外层成多数细鳞片；雄蕊5-6个，药外向；心皮多数，分离，着生于花托的内面；子房卵形，1室。瘦果，椭圆形，深紫褐色，疏生细白毛，内有种子1粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-yu83sxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-yu83sxy","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-hteupxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-hteupxj","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡灌丛或水沟边。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-niwgwhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-niwgwhq","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华东及湖北、湖南、四川、贵州云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-nfg6m5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-nfg6m5i","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-0e6qoa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-0e6qoa8","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.生物学特性喜温暖气候，较耐寒、耐旱，稍耐阴；喜阳光；忌湿涝。要以土层深厚、疏松肥沃和排水良好的砂质壤土栽种为宜。在重粘土和碱土上生长不良。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-s31q0pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-s31q0pf","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栽培技术用种子、嫁拦、扦插、分株等繁殖。种子繁殖：采用育苗移栽。6-7月采收果实，剥出种子，用湿沙贮藏备用。第2年3月播种。取出种子，连沙一起在水里搓去蜡质，然后播种，苗期注意除草、施肥，培育2年移栽。嫁接繁殖：用实生苗或分株苗作砧木，用切接和靠接最好，3-4月中旬，选取粗壮而较长枝条，除去顶梢，剪成6-7cm长接穗，具芽1-2对，砧木是将苗离地面3-6cm处剪断，进行切接，涂泥浆，把砧木和接穗封住，经培育3年成株。扦插繁殖：以夏季嫩枝为好，插穗用1×10-4α-萘乙酸浸沾1min后，插在遮荫的塑料膜棚里较易生根。分株繁殖：2-3月挖取母株发生的分蘖苗栽种。移栽按行株距各约1.3m开穴，每穴栽苗1株。每年在早春和科季，各进行中耕除草、追肥1次，肥料以人畜粪水为主。为了促进开花，每年3-4月，把枝条剪短，并摘心去顶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-bik0d1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-bik0d1o","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-4swjlv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-4swjlv9","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.性状鉴别花蕾圆形、短圆形或倒卵形，长1-1.5cm，宽4-8mm。花被片叠合，下半部被多数膜质鳞片，鳞片黄褐色，三角形，有微毛。气香，味微甜后苦，稍有油腻感。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-i2qzlia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-i2qzlia","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以花心黄色、完整饱满而未开放都为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-dmn36j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-dmn36j0","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别粉末特征：①单细胞非腺毛（花被）长至70μm，顶端钝，壁厚，稍有弯曲。②鳞片表皮细胞多角形，有众多非腺毛；气孔少见。③花粉粒棕黄色，类圆形至椭圆形，直径约40μm，外壁微有纵直纹理，并常见萌发孔2个。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-6np9gqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-6np9gqj","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-tr0e7i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-tr0e7i2","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜡梅花的香气成分，已鉴定31种，计有：乙酸（aceticacid），1，1-二乙氧基乙烷（1，1diethoxyethane），异戊醇（isoamylalcohol），1，3-二氧戊环（1，3-dioxolang），双丙酮醇（diacetonealcohol），3-丁烯-2-酮（3-butene-2-one），叶醇（3-hexen-1-ol），侧柏烯（2-thujene），月桂烯（myrcene），对聚伞花素（pcymene），柠檬烯（limonene），6-甲基-1-辛醇（6-methyl-1-octanol），苯甲醇（benzylalcohol），罗勒烯（α-ocimene），芳樟醇（linalool），氧化芳樟醇（linalooloxide），松樟酮（pinocamphone），乙酸苄酯（benzylacetate），萘（naphthalene），水杨酸甲酯（methylsalicylate），吲哚（1H-indole），β-丁香烯（β-caryophyllene），（王古）（王巴）烯（α-copaene），2，6-二叔丁基对甲苯酚（2，6-di-tertbutyl-4-methylphenol），香桧酮（sabinadetone），苯甲酸（benzoicacid），癸酸（decanoicacid），邻苯二甲酸叔丁酯（diphenatetertbutylester），十二酸（dodecanoicacid），4-癸酮（4-decanone），1，3，5-三丁基六氢-1，3，5-三氮杂苯（1，3，5-tributylhexahydro-1，3，5-triazine）。其中含量最多的是罗勒烯，其次是芳樟醇、乙酸苄酯、水杨酸甲酯、侧伯烯、柠檬烯及苯甲醇。另含红豆杉氰甙（taxiphyllin），蜡梅甙（meratin），α-胡萝卜素（α-carotene），蜡梅碱（calycanthine）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-4qt65vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-4qt65vn","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶含蜡梅碱，山蜡梅碱（chimonanthine）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-ii116da","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-ii116da","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-gf3fn3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-gf3fn3u","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.毒性：洋蜡梅碱可引起哺乳动物之强烈抽搐，作用类似士的宁。静脉注射对小鼠的平均致死量为43.79±1.89mg/kg，对大鼠为17.16±0.82mg/kg。对兔之毒性更强，大约在10-40mg之间，静脉注射后肯定致死，最大耐受量为7.5mg。中毒剂量对上述三种动物皆引起兴奋，但对蛙可引起抑制。对兔静脉注射还可降低血糖。对血细胞数目无影响。对离体兔肠、子宫有兴奋作用，但对豚鼠子宫作用微弱。在麻醉猫、犬身上可抑制心脏，降低血压。但有人认为不会引起降压。夏腊梅碱对哺乳动物有类似士的宁作用，引起强烈抽搐。静脉注射对小鼠的平均致死量为43.79±1.89mg/kg，对大鼠为17.16±0.82mg/kg，兔的最大耐受量为7.5mg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-i0f7rkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-i0f7rkp","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.其他作用：给兔静脉注射可降低血糖。对离体兔肠、子宫有兴奋作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-jtfqw1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-jtfqw1w","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】静脉注射对小鼠的平均致死量为43.79±1.89mg/kg，对大鼠为17.16±0.82mg/kg。对兔之毒性更强，大约在10-40mg之间，静脉注射后肯定致死，最大耐受量为7.5mg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-8c5rv5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-8c5rv5l","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去残梗、沙石、土块。晒干或烘干，备用"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-emmodl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-emmodl4","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；甘；微苦性凉；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-tbicwub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-tbicwub","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-puanafb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-puanafb","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解毒清热；理气开郁。主暑热烦渴；头晕；胸闷脘痞；梅核气；咽喉肿痛；百日咳；小儿麻疹；烫火伤"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-cyb8ko6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-cyb8ko6","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-9g。外用：适量，浸油涂或滴耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-ftjr3kn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-ftjr3kn","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】湿邪盛者慎用"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-s5njz5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-s5njz5g","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治久咳：铁筷子花三钱。泡开水服。(《贵阳民间药草》)②治汤火伤：蜡梅花(以)茶油浸(涂)。(《岭南采药录》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-nxmpimd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-nxmpimd","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-9h3q5mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-9h3q5mv","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：解暑，生津。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-vxa0wjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-vxa0wjl","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《浙江中药手册》：治暑温胸痞烦渴，小儿麻疹，百日咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-owdub4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-owdub4s","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《江苏植药志》：治心烦口渴，气郁胃闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155852-9dvwfv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155852-9dvwfv6","updated":"20240902155858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902155853-srf63bm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902155853-srf63bm","updated":"20240902155858"}},{"ID":"20240902155854-lk29hy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155854-lk29hy8","updated":"20240902155858"}}]}